sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant PreferencesController as UserNotificationPreferencesController
participant NotificationClient as HttpNotificationServiceClient
participant NotificationService as Notification service REST API
participant NotificationProfileRepo as INotificationProfileRepository
participant TelegramWebhook as TelegramWebhookController
participant StationRepository as IStationRepository

alt update station alert preferences via API proxy
  User->>PreferencesController: PATCH /users/:id/subscriptions/:stationId
  PreferencesController->>PreferencesController: ensureOwnUserAccess()
  PreferencesController->>NotificationClient: updateAlertPreferences(...)
  NotificationClient->>NotificationService: PATCH /notification-preferences/users/:userId/subscriptions/:stationId
  NotificationService->>NotificationProfileRepo: save(profile)
  NotificationProfileRepo-->>NotificationService: void
  NotificationService-->>NotificationClient: NotificationProfileResponse
  NotificationClient-->>PreferencesController: profile
  PreferencesController-->>User: 200 UserResponse
else link Telegram without knowing chat id
  User->>PreferencesController: POST /users/:id/delivery-channels/telegram/link-code
  PreferencesController->>NotificationClient: createTelegramLinkCode(userId)
  NotificationClient->>NotificationService: POST .../delivery-channels/telegram/link-code
  NotificationService->>NotificationProfileRepo: save(profile with link code)
  NotificationService-->>PreferencesController: TelegramLinkCodeResponse

  User->>TelegramWebhook: Telegram bot sends /link <code>
  TelegramWebhook->>NotificationProfileRepo: findByTelegramLinkCode(code)
  NotificationProfileRepo-->>TelegramWebhook: profile
  TelegramWebhook->>NotificationProfileRepo: save(linked profile)
end
